chain: ES2010
language: en
note: REAL meetings: AMI Meeting Corpus (CC BY 4.0) scenario series ES2010a-d, a role-played design team speaking spontaneously. Turns = AMI manual words merged per speaker (gap <= 2 s), turns under 2 words dropped. Gold = decisions listed in the human DECISIONS abstracts, evidence found through the human summary links; the slot list and allowed values were written by the AI assistant. Meeting dates are assigned (weekly) because AMI has none. Not the product's target domain (corporate board meetings).
now: 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
people: id=Industrial Designer, me=Marketing Expert, pm=Project Manager, ui=User Interface Designer
object: chip | decision | Chip | outcome:enum[smart processor chip,simple chip,advanced chip]
object: indicator_light | decision | Light showing the remote is sending | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: devices | decision | Devices the remote controls | outcome:enum[televisions only,multiple devices]
object: case_material | decision | Case material | outcome:enum[latex,plastic,rubber,wood]
object: changeable_case | decision | Changeable casing | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: locator | decision | Locator function | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: speech_control | decision | Voice control of functions | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: button_lights | decision | Illuminated buttons | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: battery | decision | Battery | outcome:enum[lithium,alkaline]

